otifications", "label": "Command Completion Notifications", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_close_confirmation", "label": "Close Confirmation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_settings_ui", "label": "Settings UI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_custom_keybindings", "label": "Custom Keybindings", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_window_state_persistence", "label": "Window State Persistence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "windowstate.json is written atomically and saved on an interval, on logout/shutdown, and when hiding to the tray, to avoid corruption/data loss; restore logic was hardened so it no longer fails from bad bounds while minimized, no longer wipes saved tabs during an elevated relaunch or before the first load finishes, and isolates a single bad saved tab command so it does not block the others."}, {"id": "readme_shell_cwd_integration", "label": "Shell CWD Integration Strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PowerShell integration runs via launch arguments where possible because that is more reliable; CMD and bash-like shells lack that mechanism so they get a startup hook instead, so CWD flows to the status bar more reliably across shell types."}, {"id": "readme_webgl_redraw_fix", "label": "WebGL Redraw-after-Clear Fix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The WebGL renderer's glyph atlas can leave stale pixels after clear/CLS; forcing a full redraw after erase-in-display prevents glyphs from overlapping."}, {"id": "readme_tab_row_scroll", "label": "Tab Row Single Strip w/ Scroll", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_copy_paste", "label": "Copy / Paste Shortcuts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_export_buffer_shortcut", "label": "Export Buffer to File Shortcut", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_settingsstore", "label": "SettingsStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_sessionstore", "label": "SessionStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_workspacestore", "label": "WorkspaceStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_snippetstore", "label": "SnippetStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_terminallogger", "label": "Ter